  "description": "Operating Area: Mallorca-Balearic Islands\n\nThe art of sailing with space, luxury and exclusivity\n\nDiscover an unrivalled sailing experience aboard the spectacular Sunreef 74, a luxury catamaran designed for those seeking the ultimate in comfort, privacy and elegance at sea. With its impressive dimensions, spacious open-plan areas and exceptional stability, this exclusive yacht offers a unique way to explore the crystal-clear waters of Mallorca and the Balearic Islands.\n\nCombining the refinement of a luxury villa with the freedom of sailing, the Sunreef 74 is the perfect setting for family holidays, getaways with friends, private celebrations or multi-day cruises around the Mediterranean.\n\nSpaces designed for enjoyment\nFrom the very first moment, it impresses with its vast interior and exterior spaces. Its spacious panoramic saloon, flooded with natural light thanks to its large windows, flows seamlessly into the outdoor areas, creating an elegant, welcoming and relaxed atmosphere.\n\nThe spacious decks offer a variety of areas to enjoy the sea:\n• Large panoramic flybridge with a lounge area and sun deck.\n• A spacious aft cockpit, ideal for al fresco breakfasts, lunches or dinners.\n• A spacious swim platform with direct access to the sea.\n• A relaxation area at the bow offering stunning views whilst underway.\n• Multiple private spaces for sunbathing or enjoying a drink at sunset.\n\nLuxury accommodation\nThe Sunreef 74 offers accommodation for up to 8 guests in elegant en-suite cabins, designed to ensure maximum comfort and privacy throughout your stay.\nEach cabin features high-quality finishes, independent climate control and ample storage space, creating an exclusive atmosphere comparable to that of a luxury hotel suite.\n\nSmooth and comfortable sailing\nThanks to its multihull design, the Sunreef 74 offers extremely stable, quiet and efficient sailing, ideal for both relaxed coastal cruises and island-hopping trips.\nIts generous beam provides a sense of space that is hard to find even on longer yachts, making it one of the most sought-after options for luxury charters in the Mediterranean.\n\nTailor-made experiences\nDuring your charter, you can discover some of Mallorca’s most exclusive spots:\n• Cala Llamp\n• Cala Blanca\n• Portals Vells\n• Es Trenc\n• Dragonera Island\n• Cabrera\n• Malgrats Islands\n• Ibiza and Formentera or Menorca (multi-day or week-long charters)\n\nEnjoy swimming in turquoise waters, snorkelling, stand-up paddleboarding, local cuisine and unforgettable sunsets from the comfort of your own private yacht.",
